ous bryophytes: a highly neglected group","link":"https://academic.oup.com/aob/article/135/6/1047/7960091?rss=1","date":1737158400000,"author":"","category":"Environment","siteTitle":"Annals of Botany Current Issue","siteHash":"4dcd6862a4440fa3d0035d60c859bc6843aabf7c9786ca821198500245ae243e","entryHash":"bf39af7df039d5ab0b3e00da3a0d3fd78ae15b63d7f63d16f27cb00bae7e41b5"},{"title":"Ancient reticulation, incomplete lineage sorting and the evolution of the pyrenoid at the dawn of hornwort diversification","link":"https://academic.oup.com/aob/article/135/6/1199/7959356?rss=1","date":1737072000000,"author":"","category":"Environment","siteTitle":"Annals of Botany Current Issue","siteHash":"4dcd6862a4440fa3d0035d60c859bc6843aabf7c9786ca821198500245ae243e","entryHash":"654ba60dcbc979f12053fb69e7de313113ea869ea664ce29082c096e1689f2da"},{"title":"Fire and seed dormancy: a global meta-analysis","link":"https://academic.oup.com/aob/article/135/6/1059/7933536?rss=1","date":1735257600000,"author":"","category":"Environment","siteTitle":"Annals of Botany Current Issue","siteHash":"4dcd6862a4440fa3d0035d60c859bc6843aabf7c9786ca821198500245ae243e","entryHash":"64d6b11f2892e15aa06e8053d4d6087709ff8f128b41a0349c586a79484eebb1"},{"title":"Integrating datasets from herbarium specimens and images to treat a Neotropical myrtle species complex","link":"https://academic.oup.com/aob/article/135/6/1075/7829000?rss=1","date":1729468800000,"author":"","category":"Environment","siteTitle":"Annals of Botany Current Issue","siteHash":"4dcd6862a4440fa3d0035d60c859bc6843aabf7c9786ca821198500245ae243e","entryHash":"b9a5a06d20724d4c04b0007008bb9f7785b7479d2bc38d10f34325c7dd4bf6a6"}],"totalEntries":16}